Menu-bar icon only (no "tailscale" text) on macOS; quit cleanly on SIGTERM (so a
launchd stop/logout/unload does not leave the menu-bar process running); make the
systray "Connect" action start interactive login on a logged-out node so the login
URL opens in the system browser (as "tailscale up" would); and add a macOS "Check
for updates" item that hands off to the bundled Mavergreen Sparkle updater.

--- client/systray/systray.go.orig
